SWEET boot profile (patch 0121, docs/PLAN-BOOT-SPEED.md M3): sweet_cpustat.c prints per-process CPU and the UFS counters (ios, cmds, KiB, busy, lock wait, longest command) every sweetcpustat=N s (default 60, 0 = off) and logs when migrationpluginwrapper/datamigrator start and exit (5 s resolution). Read-only diagnostics; counters are kept by sweet_ufs_strategy under its lock.

